WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.000
The city wakes up without checking our plans.

00:00:07.000 --> 00:00:14.000
Another street. Another little story.

00:00:14.000 --> 00:00:21.000
Documenting the essentials, naturally.

00:00:21.000 --> 00:00:28.000
It would be rude not to look.

00:00:28.000 --> 00:00:35.000
Same sky. Another day worth keeping.
